WEBVTT

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.980
Trust turns into distrust,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.270
despair and chaos begins
to rule over the world.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.730
Are you all right, Pavel?

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.560
You seemed quite disturbed.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.190
I had a terrible dream...

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:44.440
I'm worried about Kasel.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.560
Will he be able to successfully
get the Holy Sword?

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.480
He'll be fine.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.440
Let's put our faith in the young ones.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:04.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:09.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:19.720
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:24.190
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:28.730
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:38.650
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.980
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:43.810
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:48.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.350
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:03.230
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.900
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.100
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.520
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.980
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.190
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:20.060
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.920
<i></i>Blade of Vengeance,

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.920
<i></i>Blooms in Darkness

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:24.100
Light was about to turn into
pitch-black darkness.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.600
We depart as soon as the horses
have had some reset.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:34.850
The World Tree is close.
We must catch up with Princess Scarlet.

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:36.060
Yes.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:43.900
Who would have thought that your friend
Kasel was the heir to the Holy Sword...

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.190
You knew, didn't you?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.150
Yes...

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.230
Then why didn't you tell us?

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.900
If we knew that the heir
to the Holy Sword existed,

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.850
we could have strategized accordingly.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:58.100
We could even have
helped Kasel directly, too.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.150
That's because...

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:04.230
...when I spoke to Kasel
at the Tower of the Sage...

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.480
You're King Kyle's...?!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:11.190
I still can't believe
I'm the son of King Kyle.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.940
That's why I have to find out
for myself if it's true.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:19.060
If it is true... I want to find
the Holy Sword Aea.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:23.650
With the Holy Sword,
I'm sure I can protect everyone!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.150
Do you realize how dangerous
this is going to be?

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:31.350
Yeah. But I still want
to get the Holy Sword!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:35.520
I don't want to see anyone else
suffer because of the Demons.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:41.020
I could really feel how strong
his determination was.

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:45.190
Kasel was trying to fight the Demons
from the bottom of his heart!

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:49.900
As you said, Captain Demia,
we probably could have helped him.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:57.230
However, Kasel is determining his
own destiny without anyone's guidance...

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.520
I felt that, only through
that type of growth,

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.940
can he truly become the heir
to the Holy Sword.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.020
You could be right.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:11.770
But the fate of the whole world
rests on his shoulders.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:15.520
It's much too heavy a load
for one person to carry.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.980
To become a knight
that protects everyone...

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:21.980
That was Kasel's dream,
from a very young age.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.810
Some laughed at him
calling it a silly dream,

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:31.440
but he was serious, after the hardship
of losing his mother to the Demons.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:35.230
We must not lose any more lives...

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:40.980
Nobody else should have to despair
from losing a loved one.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:44.400
That was what Kasel has been
thinking this whole time.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.520
The day Kasel picks up his sword
to protect everyone,

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:50.020
I will become his shield.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:53.690
That was the choice
I made a long time ago.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:01.400
Now is that time.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.980
Yes.

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.310
The World Tree is close.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.270
Once we regroup with Kasel,
be ready to fight the Demon Lord.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:20.400
I have just one goal:
to kill the Demon that killed my friends.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.900
I will do whatever is necessary for that.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.900
Whatever is necessary... Right.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:33.900
I'm concerned about what I saw
in Illya's research notes.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:39.600
Who was the person that told Illya
that Kyle was in danger?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:44.440
Also, if King Kyle was
taken over by dark powers,

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:50.650
doesn't the same risk apply to Kasel,
the current heir to the Holy Sword?

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.400
Is there anything we can do to help...?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.190
That has nothing to do with me.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:01.730
According to Dominix,
the Demon that attacked the Black Edge

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.900
is a sorcerer named Malduk.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.560
Malduk...

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.440
Yes. In the previous battle 100 years ago,

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.980
it is said that he was using
the "undead"--moving corpses.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:26.400
I will kill him with my own hands...!

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:33.270
I've never had any doubt...

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:38.350
That the light would
guide us to the right path.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:43.270
To a bright future, full of hope...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.440
But...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:53.560
Why did the goddess Lua take away
the Holy Sword's power?

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.730
I'm sure there was some reason.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:01.150
No matter what the reason was,
there's no doubt that she took the power away.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:05.310
What would you do if Lua betrays you, too?

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.150
Kasel.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.100
What's wrong, Frey?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.730
I, uh... I have to talk to you.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:19.810
Oh, I'm so thirsty all of a sudden!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.350
Let's take a quick break!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.150
But, we need to hurry...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.650
Don't worry!

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.690
So what is it?

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.270
Well, um...

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:39.690
Once we get the Holy Sword,
we will have to fight the Dark Lord.

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:42.650
But the Dark Lord is King Kyle himself.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.690
Can you fight him?

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.650
Also... If you were able to defeat him,

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:50.600
what would happen to you after that...?

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:55.350
If the Dark Lord is indeed
King Kyle himself,

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:58.190
I have to be the one to stop him.

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:00.850
If I said I have no worries, I'd be lying,

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:04.690
but hearing Ms. Maria's
story made me think.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:11.100
King Kyle fought the Dark Lord to the end,
without giving up, sacrificing himself.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:14.020
My feeling of respect towards
King Kyle is stronger than

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:18.400
my fear that I'd face the same fate.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.190
Kasel...

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:22.650
I think King Kyle wanted to keep fighting

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:26.850
because he wanted to protect
the people dear to him.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.850
Just like King Kyle
fought without hesitation,

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.810
I, too, will fight without worry.

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:36.480
If I can protect everyone,
it doesn't matter what happens to me!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.560
Of course it matters what happens to you!

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.690
Frey...

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:46.560
I also want to protect everyone.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:50.520
But I'll never let you sacrifice yourself!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:53.100
Even if we could protect everyone else,

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:58.100
I don't even want to imagine
a world without you!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.560
Nobody deserves to be sacrificed--
not a single person!

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.900
Did you forget the promise
we made at the snow mountain?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:08.650
You said you'd never
push yourself excessively!

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:17.770
Thanks for being concerned for me, Frey.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.940
That said, I think it'll all be fine.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:24.310
Besides, I trust you all.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:28.480
Frey, Roi, Cleo, Miss Selene...

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.690
I have everyone on my side.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.810
With your help, I'm sure I can
defeat the Dark Lord,

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.150
and I'm sure I won't die.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:40.020
So Frey, don't worry, and follow me.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:46.850
Fine. I... I believe in you, Kasel!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.940
You do sometimes read the room, huh?

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.900
Not "sometimes"!

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:03.600
I really can't take my eyes off those two.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.020
They're both always willing
to push their own needs aside

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.900
if they're worried about others.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.520
So I can't take my eyes off them...

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.560
We have to protect them.
That's how I feel.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:19.060
For me, you all are a beacon of hope.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.560
Selene...

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:26.900
As long as I am with you all,
I feel we can smash any darkness.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.900
So that's the World Tree...

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.730
Yes. Let's go..

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:05.400
This place truly deserves
to be called holy...

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.060
Are Kasel and his companions
already here...?

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.520
Is that the Holy Sword Aea...?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.020
Riheet!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.440
Now I can avenge my friends...

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.980
What are you talking about?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:27.190
Dominix said the Holy Sword
can only be used by the heir!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.480
We need to give that to Kasel!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:33.190
Kasel? Where is he, then?

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:39.270
You can go ahead and wait
for someone to help you.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.520
I have work to do.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:44.150
No! Let go of the Holy Sword, Riheet!

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:46.730
Get out of my way!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:51.560
I don't need anyone's help.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.980
I will avenge the death of my friends.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:03.100
I am certain.
The Holy Sword Aea is here...

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:10.150
Curse you, Lua!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:11.900
I must restore my strength.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:17.900
Then I, Malduk, will handle
the Holy Sword Aea.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.100
Is that...?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.440
My child, please...

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.560
What just happened?!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:48.980
You're...

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.900
Riheet, is that...?

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.440
Yeah... The Demon that killed my friends!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:10.150
Hiding the Holy Sword Aea at
the World Tree to keep it from us, huh?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.520
Is this your doing?!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:17.230
This is the power of
the Dark Lord, Angmund!

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:30.310
Hand over the Holy Sword.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.560
If you want it so bad,
I'll lodge it into your body!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.940
Don't go charging in alone!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.730
Who asked for your help?

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:56.810
Oh, I remember. You're that
Dark Elf from the other day.

00:16:56.810 --> 00:17:00.060
Your friends died quite terribly,
didn't they?

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.850
So bad, they weren't even worth
turning into the undead!

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.060
Riheet!

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:20.810
Now, let me hear your final scream.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.400
Not on my watch!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.690
Death is the most beautiful,
most precious thing in the world.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.480
During that fateful moment,
even you, the lowliest creatures,

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.520
are ascended into a holy being!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.600
Silence!

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.690
Vengeance!

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:48.440
You dare injure me...?!

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:54.310
An insect like you can never defeat me!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.400
Riheet!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:06.480
Die!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.980
I will never relent...!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:23.190
No matter what happens to me,
I will take you down!

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:41.440
How dare you!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.900
Back off!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.440
You did it...

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:33.770
Beating this guy won't
bring anyone back...

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.190
Not my friends, anyone...

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.600
Is that...?

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.560
The Dark Lord, Angmund!

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.150
The Holy Sword!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:56.770
I'll take the Holy Sword back!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:11.940
Demia!

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:13.230
Your Highness.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:16.980
Step away from the princess!

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:20.190
Clause!

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.560
I'm sorry I arrived late.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.650
Your Highness, are you injured?

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.650
I'm fine!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.270
Who is that...?

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:30.980
That's the Dark Lord, Angmund.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:03.980
Kasel!

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:19.270
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.980
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.770
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:28.810
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:45.350
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:51.270
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:22:51.270 --> 00:22:55.900
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:22:55.900 --> 00:23:02.560
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:23:02.560 --> 00:23:08.020
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:10.310
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:23:10.310 --> 00:23:13.690
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:16.350
<i>This one wish</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.230
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.980
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.770
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:27.560
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:30.350
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:33.190
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:36.150
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.730
The Holy Sword Aea is now
in the hands of the Dark Lord.

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:54.020
The end of the world creeps closer.

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:57.230
Kasel and his friends take a stand.

00:23:57.230 --> 00:24:00.730
To protect the world. To protect everyone.

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>The Battle of

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>the World Tree
